Description: CIOS Wayland Compositor
 Minimal Wayland compositor for the CIOS runtime. Uses wlroots 0.18+
 with DRM/KMS backend, XWayland support, layer-shell for topbar,
 and a JSON IPC protocol for runtime communication.
